WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:23.753
In the terminal, chat is a full screen app on the same API as the web page. Press question mark to list every key, and change any of them in your own config. The prompt command changes how the message box looks. Ask something and a tool call shows with its time. Context tells you how much of the model's window you are using. Then name the conversation, fork it, and list your sessions.
